 "notes": [
  "Posted 28 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "No starting section is posted and the list has no Objective or named starting location. Prepared Defenses is in the list; the strategy says the normal start is You May Start Your Landing, Imperial Arrest Order and Mobilization Points (or There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement instead of Mobilization Points against three-effect starts), so no single starting effect is set. All count toward the 60.",
  "Dark pages dested for the dual-printed Hoth cards: Hoth (Dark), Hoth: Defensive Perimeter (3rd Marker) (Dark), Hoth: Echo Docking Bay (Dark), Ice Storm (Dark).",
  "Posted 'Battle Deployment - Admiral's Order' dested the Admiral's Order Battle Deployment.",
  "Secret Plans and There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement are 2001 Effects (not Defensive Shields).",
  "The strategy says the deck was built by 'Steebo' and that the poster's own version plays only 2 Trample; the list is kept as posted (3 Trample). Total 60.",
  "The strategy mentions results in 'the last few tournies' but names no event, so it stays a general deck."
